    "updated_at": "2022-10-05T23:04:14Z",
    "body": "I'd suggest a 4th option for platforms that don't have an emoji picker: don't implement `showEmojiPicker` at all, just leave the field undefined.\r\n\r\nOnce this is rolled out, `if (typeof el.showEmojiPicker === 'function')` blocks will be needed to handle legacy browsers anyways.\r\n\r\nTwo birds, one stone...",
